@startuml Auto_Deploy_Data_Flow_Diagram
!define DARKBLUE
!define LIGHTBLUE

title Auto Deploy Agent - Data Flow Diagram

' Actors
actor User
entity "File System" as FileSystem
entity "Project Directory" as ProjectDir
entity "Environment Variables" as EnvVars

database "Ollama LLM" as Ollama_DB
database "Git Repository" as GitRepo
database "Deployment Platforms" as DeployPlatforms

' Processes
component "detect_project_type()" as P1
component "recommend_platform()" as P2
component "install_cli()" as P3
component "create_required_files()" as P4
component "build_project()" as P5
component "ensure_git_ready_for_deployment()" as P6
component "deploy_to_platform()" as P7

' User Actions
User --> P1: "Trigger deployment"
User --> P2

' Data flows from system
ProjectDir --> P1: "List files & folders"
P1 --> Ollama_DB: "Send project structure"
Ollama_DB --> P1: "Detected project type\n(nextjs, vite, react,\npython-flask, etc.)"
P1 --> P2: "project_type"

' Recommendation flow
P2 --> Ollama_DB: "Query best platform"
Ollama_DB --> P2: "Platform recommendation\n+ setup steps"
P2 --> User: "Display recommendation"
User --> P3: "Confirm platform"

' CLI Installation flow
P3 --> EnvVars: "Check CLI_MAP config"
P3 --> FileSystem: "Verify CLI installed"
FileSystem --> P3: "CLI status"
P3 --> User: "Request install permission"
User --> P3: "yes/no"
P3 --> FileSystem: "Execute install commands"

' File Management flow
ProjectDir --> P4: "Check for package.json,\nrequirements.txt"
P4 --> FileSystem: "Create missing files"

' Build flow
P4 --> P5: "project_type, platform"
P5 --> FileSystem: "Execute build commands\n(npm install, build, etc.)"
FileSystem --> P5: "Build artifacts"

' Git preparation flow
ProjectDir --> P6: "Check for .git"
P6 --> GitRepo: "Initialize repo if needed"
P6 --> GitRepo: "Check remote URL"
GitRepo --> P6: "Remote URL"
ProjectDir --> P6: "Get uncommitted changes"
P6 --> GitRepo: "Auto-commit if needed"

' Deployment flow
P6 --> P7: "Confirm git ready"
P7 --> DeployPlatforms: "Send artifacts + config"
DeployPlatforms --> P7: "Deployment status"
P7 --> User: "Deployment result"
P7 --> DeployPlatforms: "Validate deployment\n(health check)"

' Data storage
EnvVars -.-> P1: "MODEL selection"
EnvVars -.-> P2: "OLLAMA settings"
EnvVars -.-> P3: "CLI configurations"

note bottom
    Data flows through the system from left to right:
    1. User initiates deployment
    2. System analyzes project structure
    3. Gets AI-powered recommendations
    4. Installs required tools
    5. Creates deployment configuration files
    6. Builds the project
    7. Prepares Git repository
    8. Deploys to selected platform
    9. Validates successful deployment
end note

@enduml
